NOTE ON MODEL WEIGHTS

This MIT licence covers the Soundbox application code only. It does not cover
the machine-learning model weights that Soundbox can download and run. Those
are distributed by third parties under their own licences, several of which
prohibit commercial use.

Soundbox does not redistribute any model weights. It downloads them from
Hugging Face at the user's direction, using the user's own account and access
token where the repository is gated.

Audio generated by a given model is subject to that model's licence. See the
Models table in README.md for a summary and the linked licence for the
authoritative terms.
